              of this object in the
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/over+quasi-category"} over (∞,1)-category
            %p
              By the discussion at
              %a{:href => "http://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/limit+in+a+quasi-category#Tensoring"} Tensoring and cotensoring with an ∞-groupoid
              we have that this powering operation is on fibrant objects modeled by the powering in the
              = succeed "-" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sSet"} sSet
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/enriched+model+category"} enriched model category
              = succeed "." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                      %msup
                        %mi C
