                        %mi cov
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X \in [C^{op}, sSet]_{inj,cov}
              is fibrant, it satisfies
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/descent+for+simplicial+presheaves"} descent for simplicial presheaves
              at
              = succeed "s." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cech+cover"} Cech cover
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Quillen+bifunctor"} Quillen bifunctor
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
